msgid "Cómo funciona"
msgstr "How it works"

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:6
msgid "Reserva con contexto. Gestiona sin caos."
msgstr "Book with context. Manage without chaos."

#: .\templates\includes\landing\how_section.html:8
msgid ""
"\n"
"          Aquí no vas a ciegas: ves <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">qué "
"incluye</span>,\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">cómo será</span> y\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">en qué punto está</span> tu "
"solicitud en todo momento.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          You never book blindly: see <span class=\"font-semibold u-"
"text\">what’s included</span>,\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">what to expect</span>, and\n"
"          <span class=\"font-semibold u-text\">the exact status</span> of "
